<title>USA: FSA has capacity for Philadelphia Gas Works bonds.</title>
<headline>FSA has capacity for Philadelphia Gas Works bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said on Monday it has remaining secondary market insurance capacity for Philadelphia, Pa., Gas Works revenue bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity is limited and is available on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>
<p>For further details, please contact Tom Byrne, Greg Haggerty, or Alan Steinfeld at 212 826-0601.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
